OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening 
OL,6,Fwill be dry with a frost setting. The  
OL,7,Frest of the night will be dry with a   
OL,8,Fwidespread frost and a few freezing    
OL,9,Fpatches. Light winds except for the    
OL,10,Fwestern Isles where winds will freshen 
OL,11,Fby dawn.                               
OL,13,CSaturday:FA cloudy and mainly dry day, 
OL,14,Fperhaps some early brightness for      
OL,15,FCaithness and Sutherland. Rain is      
OL,16,Flikely to spread northeast during the  
OL,17,Fafternoon. Windy at times for the      
OL,18,FHebrides.                              
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
